{"title":"2024 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Daily_Dose_of_Math\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_DDM\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by DDM</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Math-X_(MATH-X)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Math-X (MATH-X)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(Detailed_Explanation)_🚀⚡📊\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution  (Detailed Explanation) 🚀⚡📊</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Central_Valley_Math_Circle_(Goes_through_full_thought_process)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Central Valley Math Circle (Goes through full thought process)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Video_by_MathTalks_Now\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video by MathTalks_Now</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(A_Clever_Explanation_You’ll_Get_Instantly)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (A Clever Explanation You’ll Get Instantly)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(easy_to_digest)_by_Power_Solve\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">11</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution  (easy to digest) by Power Solve</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_NiuniuMaths_(Easy_to_understand!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">12</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by NiuniuMaths (Easy to understand!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-13\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2_by_SpreadTheMathLove\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">13</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 2 by SpreadTheMathLove</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-14\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_CosineMethod_[🔥Fast_and_Easy🔥]\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">14</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by CosineMethod [🔥Fast and Easy🔥]</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-15\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Interstigation\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">15</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Interstigation</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-16\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">16</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-17\"><a href=\"#Video_solution_by_TheNeuralMathAcademy\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">17</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video solution by TheNeuralMathAcademy</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-18\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_SquishBJ_(AIME_Qualifier)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">18</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by SquishBJ (AIME Qualifier)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-19\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">19</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Aaliyah rolls two standard 6-sided dice. She notices that the product of the two numbers rolled is a multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. Which of the following integers cannot be the sum of the two numbers?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/0/180a6671b054460660450fd54cfede93ceb6cf11.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) } 5\\qquad\\textbf{(B) } 6\\qquad\\textbf{(C) } 7\\qquad\\textbf{(D) } 8\\qquad\\textbf{(E) } 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"355\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>First, figure out all pairs of numbers whose product is 6. Then, using the process of elimination, we can find the following: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/6/a46f6af01fcf3bb5f6cac2316bc4de9bb3906bec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"31\" height=\"18\" /> is possible: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/2/7b2acbb14d3d8c3be4519bb070578c630129e2bb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\times 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" /> \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/9/169b8d69bd74a91e72ec43123070d770633a340a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(C)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"30\" height=\"18\" /> is possible: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/2/592d1b3f996079ebb5e8f92be586764e8a23f7fa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1\\times 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" /> \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/0/b305929a95b53f14a0ad53eba1d8560626e1f28b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(D)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"31\" height=\"18\" /> is possible: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8454d42b3c5c8e2a7c2dcfa8bcfe83215aa58add.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\times 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" /> \n</p><p>The only integer that cannot be the sum is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/e/0ae91610c75442e1e7382a1541d673303cd608e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B) } 6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"57\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>We can prove that B is correct because the only ordered pairs that add to 6 is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/f/77f46e8ad13e4a3e569bb6c47d1d642243a3119d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1,5)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" /> , <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/0/7501f57059013e6eea93096092e89340a12d2155.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(5,1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/f/97f4d1e83d6eef61f31d78844deb189c54a7abc3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2,4)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/b/7cb9265e7854534e5c082e16eb10470d08d46e1f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(4,2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" />, and ,<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/0/9a078b263b69698546e4c4300872e978a126f665.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(3,3)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" />, and these multiply to 5, 8, and 9.\n</p><p>Slight changes ~ VersatileGopher38\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>First, see that in order for the two numbers to have a product of 6, it must either have 6 as a factor or have factors that have a product of 6 (Notably <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/2/7b2acbb14d3d8c3be4519bb070578c630129e2bb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\times 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" />).\n</p><p>When we look at the answer choices, we see that answers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/7/f872b7c391caefd92981cc0558aeafe701c0b6a0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C, D, E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" /> all are more than 6, so they can all be added as a sum of 6. Answer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> works because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/1/f51568fcfbf4352db805186994ea99d9cdfdf563.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2+3=5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"73\" height=\"14\" />, so 6 is the only answer choice that doesn't work. Thus, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/e/0ae91610c75442e1e7382a1541d673303cd608e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B) } 6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"57\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Daily_Dose_of_Math\">Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/bSPWqeNO11M?si=HIzlxPjMfvGM5lxR\">https://youtu.be/bSPWqeNO11M?si=HIzlxPjMfvGM5lxR</a>\n</p><p>~Thesmartgreekmathdude\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_DDM\">Video Solution by DDM</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by DDM\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/3MtJRXIIxyM\">https://youtu.be/3MtJRXIIxyM</a>\n</p><p>~piggydude\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_by_Math-X_.28MATH-X.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Math-X_(MATH-X)\">Video Solution by Math-X (MATH-X)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Math-X (MATH-X)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/BaE00H2SHQM?si=W8N4vwOx84KauOA6&amp;t=1108\">https://youtu.be/BaE00H2SHQM?si=W8N4vwOx84KauOA6&amp;t=1108</a>\n</p><p>~Math-X \n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28Detailed_Explanation.29_.F0.9F.9A.80.E2.9A.A1.F0.9F.93.8A\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(Detailed_Explanation)_🚀⚡📊\">Video Solution  (Detailed Explanation) 🚀⚡📊</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution  (Detailed Explanation) 🚀⚡📊\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Youtube Link ⬇️\n</p><p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/SreOL9LLmiI\">https://youtu.be/SreOL9LLmiI</a>\n</p><p>~ ChillGuyDoesMath&#160;:)\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_by_Central_Valley_Math_Circle_.28Goes_through_full_thought_process.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Central_Valley_Math_Circle_(Goes_through_full_thought_process)\">Video Solution by Central Valley Math Circle (Goes through full thought process)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Central Valley Math Circle (Goes through full thought process)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/SjMK0jrVgj0\">https://youtu.be/SjMK0jrVgj0</a>\n</p><p>~mr_mathman\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_by_MathTalks_Now\">Video by MathTalks_Now</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Video by MathTalks_Now\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=crn37TRMLv4\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=crn37TRMLv4</a>\n</p><p>-rc1219\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28A_Clever_Explanation_You.E2.80.99ll_Get_Instantly.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(A_Clever_Explanation_You’ll_Get_Instantly)\">Video Solution (A Clever Explanation You’ll Get Instantly)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (A Clever Explanation You’ll Get Instantly)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/5ZIFnqymdDQ?si=eqTGEN2doXnn-oZE&amp;t=443\">https://youtu.be/5ZIFnqymdDQ?si=eqTGEN2doXnn-oZE&amp;t=443</a>\n</p><p>~hsnacademy\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28easy_to_digest.29_by_Power_Solve\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(easy_to_digest)_by_Power_Solve\">Video Solution  (easy to digest) by Power Solve</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=11\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution  (easy to digest) by Power Solve\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/HE7JjZQ6xCk?si=2M33-oRy1ExY3_6l&amp;t=239\">https://youtu.be/HE7JjZQ6xCk?si=2M33-oRy1ExY3_6l&amp;t=239</a>\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_by_NiuniuMaths_.28Easy_to_understand.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_NiuniuMaths_(Easy_to_understand!)\">Video Solution by NiuniuMaths (Easy to understand!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=12\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by NiuniuMaths (Easy 